{"overview":"وقتی کارآگاه قتل‌محور نزدیک به بازنشستگی، سِتار اوزتورک، به همراه شریک پرونده‌اش، کمال مک‌آلیستر، یک پروندهٔ نهایی دریافت می‌کند، به سلسله‌ای از قتل‌های بی‌رحمانه و پیچیده پی می‌برند؛ به زودی متوجه می‌شوند که با یک قاتل زنجیره‌ای سر و کار دارند که انگیزه‌هایش به بدعت‌های اسلامی و صوفی‌گری مرتبط است و در حین کشف پرونده، می‌فهمند حل آن تنها نقششان در این ماجرا نیست.","tagline":"","overview_en":"When close-to-retirement homicide detective Settar Öztürk is assigned a final case with his case partner Kemal McAllister, they discover a series of ruthless and operose murders. They soon discover they are dealing with a serial killer whose motives are connected with Islamic heresy and sufism. As the case disentangles, the detectives find out solving the case is not their only role in this picture.","tagline_en":"Some stones are better left unturned.","runtime":53,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":8,"y":2020,"poster":"/e1zZoMChCOHnFGkHhPZ8zg1GEHc.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":8,"y":2022,"poster":"/5mxHd14sxqN2T7FTORuImG7hhuA.jpg"}],"episodes":16,"crew":["Emin Alper","Emre Kayiş"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["TR"],"cast":[{"name":"Kenan İmirzalıoğlu","role":"Kemal","photo":"/c94CqMj4HxB52K766JkZo0B2x7M.jpg"},{"name":"Ahmet Mümtaz Taylan","role":"Settar","photo":"/7BcirImyPmuD8PxMVKPx6xefunW.jpg"},{"name":"Melisa Sözen","role":"Yaşar","photo":"/c0yFUMePzSfU4HONDIRGGcqtyt4.jpg"},{"name":"Sevinç Kumaş","role":"Avukat","photo":"/si1CUdOJpEw9GfWmWbOjVaefU7I.jpg"},{"name":"Müfit Kayacan","role":"Arap","photo":"/2QVDWWQj45uOgnD2DUkB1tC5LWt.jpg"},{"name":"Ercan Kesal","role":"","photo":"/krKWIjwR9oDRP3YWET81hsx4SwX.jpg"},{"name":"Hatice Aslan","role":"","photo":"/3AfcaaXYatSN5njBi3EbMzEG3Lg.jpg"},{"name":"Rıza Akın","role":"","photo":"/4aOcfXnUJc9nBoSPA320QsRKY6s.jpg"},{"name":"Özgür Emre Yıldırım","role":"","photo":"/pekejv4I94Hp1UbLq3G3ksf3jkB.jpg"},{"name":"Mustafa Haki Karakaya","role":"Güneş","photo":""},{"name":"Erdem Kaynarca","role":"Celal","p